pinging, prompting, and demanding our

4
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.360
immediate attention. Drop that aggressive
operating system into the life

5
00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:20.640
of a child with an odd ADHD profile, a
combination

6
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:24.640
of autism and ADHD, and the friction is
