18
00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:01.640
They need technology that natively adapts
to child the's unique

19
00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:04.200
operating system. Meet Spark.

20
00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:10.120
Powered by Claude Haiku, this
custom-built, non-coercive robotic companion rejects

21
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:14.520
