35
00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:07.040
In reality, it is a finite physiological
resource.

36
00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:11.200
When a child's internal cognitive fuel
runs low, Spark activates

37
00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:12.960
its prosthetic framework.

38
00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:17.920
The robot provides external scaffolding,
managing routines and transition warnings

39
00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:21.120
