an amygdala

46
00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:46.160
hijack. Spark responds to these events by
initiating the three

47
00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:49.760
S's protocol, safety, silence, and space.

48
00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:52.520
The robot intentionally stops moving.

49
00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:53.960
It stops talking.

50
00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:55.800
It makes zero demands.

51
00:02:55.800 --> 00:03:00.280
Consumer electronics are engineered to
beep and blink to maximize

52
00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:04.920
engagement. Spark proves that sometimes
the most sophisticated feature a

53
