69
00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:06.960
Neurodivergence operates like a different
operating system running on standard

70
00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:12.560
human hardware. Standard consumer
technology stubbornly treats any non-compliance to

71
00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:15.520
