72
00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:17.440
be overridden and fixed.

73
00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:22.240
The SPARC project demonstrates that
human-facing AI can prioritize nervous

74
00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.800
